{"seq":1,"slug":"raycast-deep-customization","title":"Raycast 深度定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/raycast-deep-customization","wordCount":1071,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"raycast-深度定制\">Raycast 深度定制</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Raycast 是 macOS 平台上最具开发者友好性的启动器工具。它不仅是 Spotlight 的替代品，更是一个基于 React + TypeScript 构建的可编程平台。截至 2026 年，Raycast Store 已拥有超过 1000 个社区扩展，覆盖从 GitHub 集成到 AI 对话的方方面面。与传统启动器相比，Raycast 的核心优势在于：原生级的 UI 组件系统、完整的 Node.js 运行时、以及与系统深度集成的 API 层。</p>\n<p>本文将带你从扩展开发的技术架构出发，深入掌握 Raycast 作为个人自动化中枢的全部能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"扩展架构模型\">扩展架构模型</h3><p>Raycast 扩展本质上是运行在沙箱环境中的 React 应用，但渲染目标不是 DOM 而是 Raycast 的原生 UI 层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"┌─────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│         Raycast 应用窗口             │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  原生 UI 渲染层 (List/Grid/Form)    │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  @raycast/api React 组件层          │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  Node.js 运行时 (扩展代码)          │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  系统 API (剪贴板/通知/文件系统)     │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│         Raycast 应用窗口             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  原生 UI 渲染层 (List/Grid/Form)    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  @raycast/api React 组件层          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Node.js 运行时 (扩展代码)          │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  系统 API (剪贴板/通知/文件系统)     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个扩展可以包含多个 Command，每个 Command 对应一个独立的入口文件。Command 类型包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>View Command</strong>：渲染 List、Detail、Grid 或 Form 界面</li>\n<li><strong>No-View Command</strong>：无 UI 执行，适合快速操作（复制、打开 URL 等）</li>\n<li><strong>Menu Bar Command</strong>：常驻菜单栏的状态指示器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从用户输入到系统调用，一次 Command 的完整执行路径如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[用户输入关键字] --&gt; C[Command 入口文件]&#10;    C --&gt; T{Command 类型}&#10;    T --&gt;|View| V[&quot;渲染 List / Grid / Detail / Form&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt;|No-View| N[无界面快速执行]&#10;    T --&gt;|Menu Bar| M[菜单栏常驻状态]&#10;    V --&gt; A[&quot;@raycast/api 组件层&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; A&#10;    M --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt; R[Node.js 运行时]&#10;    R --&gt; S[&quot;系统 API:剪贴板 / 通知 / 文件系统&quot;]\">graph TD\n    U[用户输入关键字] --&gt; C[Command 入口文件]\n    C --&gt; T{Command 类型}\n    T --&gt;|View| V[\"渲染 List / Grid / Detail / Form\"]\n    T --&gt;|No-View| N[无界面快速执行]\n    T --&gt;|Menu Bar| M[菜单栏常驻状态]\n    V --&gt; A[\"@raycast/api 组件层\"]\n    N --&gt; A\n    M --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; R[Node.js 运行时]\n    R --&gt; S[\"系统 API:剪贴板 / 通知 / 文件系统\"]</pre><h3 id=\"组件系统\">组件系统</h3><p><code>@raycast/api</code> 提供的核心组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>List</code></td>\n<td>可搜索列表</td>\n<td>搜索仓库、任务列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Grid</code></td>\n<td>网格布局</td>\n<td>图标选择、颜色面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Detail</code></td>\n<td>Markdown 详情</td>\n<td>文档预览、代码片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Form</code></td>\n<td>表单输入</td>\n<td>创建任务、配置设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ActionPanel</code></td>\n<td>操作菜单</td>\n<td>上下文操作集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据与状态管理\">数据与状态管理</h3><p>Raycast 扩展的状态管理分为三个层级：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>React State</strong>：组件内部状态，生命周期与界面一致</li>\n<li><strong>LocalStorage</strong>：持久化的键值存储，跨会话保留</li>\n<li><strong>Cache</strong>：带 TTL 的缓存层，适合 API 响应</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { LocalStorage, Cache } from &#39;@raycast/api&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 持久存储&#10;await LocalStorage.setItem(&#39;lastQuery&#39;, searchText);&#10;&#10;// 带过期的缓存&#10;const cache = new Cache();&#10;cache.set(&#39;repos&#39;, JSON.stringify(repos), { ttl: 300_000 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LocalStorage, Cache } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@raycast/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 持久存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LocalStorage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lastQuery'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, searchText);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 带过期的缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'repos'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(repos), { ttl: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"从零创建一个扩展\">从零创建一个扩展</h3><h4 id=\"环境准备\">环境准备</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 确保 Node.js 16+ 已安装&#10;node --version&#10;&#10;# 通过 Raycast 内置命令创建（推荐）&#10;# 打开 Raycast → 搜索 &quot;Create Extension&quot; → 选择模板&#10;&#10;# 或使用 CLI&#10;npx create-raycast-extension my-extension\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确保 Node.js 16+ 已安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通过 Raycast 内置命令创建（推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打开 Raycast → 搜索 \"Create Extension\" → 选择模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或使用 CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create-raycast-extension</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-extension</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"项目结构\">项目结构</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-extension/&#10;├── src/&#10;│   ├── index.tsx          # 主命令&#10;│   ├── search.tsx         # 搜索命令&#10;│   └── utils/&#10;│       └── api.ts         # 共享工具&#10;├── assets/                # 图标资源&#10;├── package.json           # 元数据 + Raycast 配置&#10;└── tsconfig.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-extension/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── index.tsx          # 主命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── search.tsx         # 搜索命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── utils/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── api.ts         # 共享工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── assets/                # 图标资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── package.json           # 元数据 + Raycast 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tsconfig.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"开发一个-git-仓库搜索器\">开发一个 Git 仓库搜索器</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { List, ActionPanel, Action, Icon } from &quot;@raycast/api&quot;;&#10;import { useFetch } from &quot;@raycast/utils&quot;;&#10;import { useState } from &quot;react&quot;;&#10;&#10;interface Repository {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  full_name: string;&#10;  html_url: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  stargazers_count: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export default function SearchRepos() {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&quot;&quot;);&#10;&#10;  const { data, isLoading } = useFetch&lt;{ items: Repository[] }&gt;(&#10;    `https://api.github.com/search/repositories?q=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`,&#10;    { execute: query.length &gt; 0 }&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;List&#10;      isLoading={isLoading}&#10;      searchBarPlaceholder=&quot;Search GitHub repositories...&quot;&#10;      onSearchTextChange={setQuery}&#10;      throttle&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {data?.items.map((repo) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;List.Item&#10;          key={repo.full_name}&#10;          title={repo.full_name}&#10;          subtitle={repo.description}&#10;          accessories={[{ text: `⭐ ${repo.stargazers_count}` }]}&#10;          actions={&#10;            &lt;ActionPanel&gt;&#10;              &lt;Action.OpenInBrowser url={repo.html_url} /&gt;&#10;              &lt;Action.CopyToClipboard content={repo.html_url} /&gt;&#10;            &lt;/ActionPanel&gt;&#10;          }&#10;        /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/List&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { List, ActionPanel, Action, Icon } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"@raycast/api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useFetch } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"@raycast/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useState } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  full_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  html_url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stargazers_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchRepos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useFetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Repository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    `https://api.github.com/search/repositories?q=${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encodeURIComponent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">query</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { execute: query.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      isLoading</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{isLoading}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      searchBarPlaceholder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Search GitHub repositories...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onSearchTextChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{setQuery}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      throttle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List.Item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{repo.full_name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{repo.full_name}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          subtitle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{repo.description}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          accessories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{[{ text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`⭐ ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stargazers_count</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          actions={</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;ActionPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              &#x3C;Action.OpenInBrowser url={repo.html_url} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              &#x3C;Action.CopyToClipboard content={repo.html_url} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;/ActionPanel></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/List></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"hot-reload-开发流程\">Hot Reload 开发流程</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启动开发服务器&#10;npm run dev&#10;&#10;# 在 Raycast 中自动出现开发扩展&#10;# 每次保存文件，扩展自动重新加载&#10;# 使用 console.log() 在终端查看调试输出\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启动开发服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 Raycast 中自动出现开发扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每次保存文件，扩展自动重新加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 console.log() 在终端查看调试输出</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"发布到-store\">发布到 Store</h3><p>发布流程核心步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>验证构建</strong>：<code>npm run build</code> 确保无类型错误</li>\n<li><strong>检查元数据</strong>：<code>package.json</code> 中 author、license（MIT）、categories 字段</li>\n<li><strong>截图规范</strong>：提供 1270×760px 的截图，展示核心功能</li>\n<li><strong>发布命令</strong>：<code>npm run publish</code> 自动创建 PR 到 raycast/extensions</li>\n</ol>\n<p>命名规范遵循 Apple Style Guide：首字母大写，品牌名保持原样（如 <code>GitHub</code>, <code>macOS</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"性能优化\">性能优化</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>使用 <code>useFetch</code> hook</strong> 代替手动 <code>useEffect</code> + fetch，自动处理加载态和缓存</li>\n<li><strong>开启 <code>throttle</code></strong> 属性避免搜索时过度请求</li>\n<li><strong>利用 <code>isLoading</code></strong> prop 给用户即时反馈，避免空白界面</li>\n<li><strong>缓存 API 响应</strong>：对不频繁变化的数据使用 Cache API</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"用户体验设计\">用户体验设计</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Empty State</strong>：列表为空时提供有意义的提示而非空白</li>\n<li><strong>Error Handling</strong>：用 <code>showToast()</code> 展示友好错误信息，避免崩溃</li>\n<li><strong>Action 优先级</strong>：最常用操作放在 ActionPanel 第一位（回车直接触发）</li>\n<li><strong>Keyboard Shortcuts</strong>：为高频操作分配 <code>⌘+K</code> 等快捷键</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"typescript-严格模式\">TypeScript 严格模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noUncheckedIndexedAccess&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>严格模式能在编译期捕获大量运行时错误，特别是处理 API 响应时的 undefined 访问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"官方工具\">官方工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@raycast/api</code></td>\n<td>核心 API 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@raycast/utils</code></td>\n<td>useFetch、useExec 等实用 hook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Code 扩展</td>\n<td>调试器集成、代码补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React DevTools</td>\n<td>组件状态检查（<code>⌘⌥D</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"高质量社区扩展参考\">高质量社区扩展参考</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>GitHub</strong>：仓库搜索、PR 管理、Issue 创建</li>\n<li><strong>Notion</strong>：快速捕获、数据库查询</li>\n<li><strong>Linear</strong>：任务管理与状态更新</li>\n<li><strong>Spotify</strong>：播放控制与歌曲搜索</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ai-能力集成\">AI 能力集成</h3><p>Raycast Pro 提供内置 AI 能力，扩展可以通过 <code>AI</code> API 访问：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { AI } from &#39;@raycast/api&#39;;&#10;&#10;const summary = await AI.ask(`Summarize this text: ${selectedText}`, { creativity: 0.5 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AI } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@raycast/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Summarize this text: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">selectedText</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { creativity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这使得扩展可以内建智能摘要、翻译、代码解释等能力，无需自行接入 LLM API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Raycast 的扩展开发是目前 macOS 生态中将&quot;想法变为快捷操作&quot;最高效的路径。它的 React + TypeScript 技术栈对前端开发者零门槛，原生 UI 组件避免了样式调试的负担，Hot Reload 开发体验与现代 Web 开发一致。关键要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 <code>create-raycast-extension</code> 开始，选择最接近需求的模板</li>\n<li>优先使用 <code>@raycast/utils</code> 的 hooks 而非手动状态管理</li>\n<li>严格遵循 Store 发布规范，特别是命名和截图要求</li>\n<li>利用 Cache API 和 LocalStorage 平衡响应速度与数据新鲜度</li>\n<li>将高频操作设计为 No-View Command 以获得最快响应</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Raycast 深度定制","id":"raycast-深度定制"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"扩展架构模型","id":"扩展架构模型"},{"level":3,"text":"组件系统","id":"组件系统"},{"level":3,"text":"数据与状态管理","id":"数据与状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"从零创建一个扩展","id":"从零创建一个扩展"},{"level":4,"text":"环境准备","id":"环境准备"},{"level":4,"text":"项目结构","id":"项目结构"},{"level":4,"text":"开发一个 Git 仓库搜索器","id":"开发一个-git-仓库搜索器"},{"level":4,"text":"Hot Reload 开发流程","id":"hot-reload-开发流程"},{"level":3,"text":"发布到 Store","id":"发布到-store"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"性能优化","id":"性能优化"},{"level":3,"text":"用户体验设计","id":"用户体验设计"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 严格模式","id":"typescript-严格模式"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"官方工具","id":"官方工具"},{"level":3,"text":"高质量社区扩展参考","id":"高质量社区扩展参考"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 能力集成","id":"ai-能力集成"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Alfred Workflows 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/launcher-automation/alfred-workflows"}}